## Development

### Setup docker shell
```bash
docker build -t bookmarklets-image .

docker run -it --rm -v ${PWD}:/app bookmarklets-image /bin/ash
```

### Linting and README generation
```bash
bun run lint:fix

bun run generate-readme
```

